WEBVTT

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Set the research scope. The initial graph makes the concepts and open questions visible.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:45.310
Inspect the first findings. Open a completed task and read the evidence while the investigation continues.

00:00:45.310 --> 00:01:16.190
Watch the graph evolve. Five concepts become eight. New branches turn broad inquiry into targeted research.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:41.660
Follow the revised investigation. New findings fill the regional branches; remaining gaps stay visible.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:02:05.620
Read the report and trace its sources. A structured report retains the links from conclusions to collected evidence.
